  "description": "<p data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"430\">Deze <strong data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"140\">Funko Pop! Pin Who Framed Roger Rabbit #07 – Jessica Rabbit</strong> is een iconisch <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"175\">verzamelobject</strong> gebaseerd op de klassieke film <em data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"232\">Who Framed Roger Rabbit</em>. De pin toont Jessica Rabbit in haar herkenbare glamoureuze stijl en combineert het bekende Funko-design met een compact en stijlvol pin-formaat, ideaal voor fans van de film en Funko-verzamelaars.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"517\">De Funko Pop Pin verkeert in <strong data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"489\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</strong> staat en is netjes bewaard.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"539\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"539\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<li data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"601\">🎬 Officiële Funko Pop! Pin uit <em data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"599\">Who Framed Roger Rabbit</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"643\">💄 Iconisch personage: Jessica Rabbit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"689\">📌 Geschikt om te dragen of te verzamelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"719\">✨ Zo Goed Als Nieuw staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"746\">📋 <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"746\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<li data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"762\">Merk: Funko</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"797\">Serie: Who Framed Roger Rabbit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"817\">Modelnummer: 07</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"847\">Personage: Jessica Rabbit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"872\">Type: Funko Pop! Pin</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"908\">Staat: Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"933\">📦 <strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"933\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<li data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"997\">Funko Pop! Pin Who Framed Roger Rabbit #07 – Jessica Rabbit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1065\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1026\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1029\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1065\" data-is-last-node=\"\">1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
